OL,3,GNEWSA'Cards on table' demand over
OL,4,Ajunction safety saga
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man who two and a half years ago
OL,7,Fpresented a thousand-signature petition
OL,8,Fdemanding changes to a "dangerous" road
OL,9,Fjunction has called on the local
OL,10,Fcouncil to lay its "cards on the table"
OL,11,Fand reveal its plans.
OL,13,FJohn Rhind, from Beadnall, organised
OL,14,Fcalls for improved safety measures on
OL,15,Fthe B1340 near Swinhoe, Northumberland,
OL,16,Fwhere several accidents have happened
OL,17,Fover almost a century.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
