OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Cards on table' demand over
OL,4,Ajunction safety saga
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumberland County Council said
OL,7,Fplans for the crossroads were
OL,8,Fprogressing through the design,
OL,9,Fconsultation and approval stages, but
OL,10,FRhind said: "If they have a plan,
OL,11,Fthere's no question of being open or
OL,12,Ftransparent about it."
OL,14,FThe authority said residents would be
OL,15,F"updated as the project progresses".
